B.a2c=new A.a6("Introdu\xe7\xe3o","Last updated: 11 November 2026")
B.a2_=new A.a6("What is Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o?","A phone app for day-to-day management with local SQLite data: agenda (clients and suppliers), quotes, work orders, cash and PDF. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com. No in-app ads.")
